 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Internet verbs",
     "texto": [
      "**Зайти на сайт** (to go into a website) takes **на** + accusative. **Ввести пароль** (to enter the password) takes its object in the accusative. **Скачать файл** (to download a file) and **загрузить файл** (to upload a file) also work this way.",
      "**Подключиться к сети** (to connect to the network) takes **к** + dative."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "By email",
     "texto": [
      "To say «by email» use **по** + dative: **по электронной почте** («by email»). **Электронной** and **почте** are in the singular dative.",
      "In instructions the imperative is used: **Введи пароль** (enter the password, you) and **Введите пароль** (enter the password, formal or plural). The **-те** forms are used for formal singular address or for plural; compare with **Загрузите файл**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
